# Domain modules

Product features live under `src/modules/<domain>/`. Each module owns its controller, service, entities, DTOs, and specs.

```
src/modules/engagements/engagements.module.ts
src/modules/engagements/engagements.controller.ts
src/modules/engagements/engagements.service.ts
```

Current domains: `auth`, `users`, `engagements`, `properties`, `amenities`, `regions`, `notes`.

Shared infrastructure stays at the `src/` root: `common`, `config`, `database`, `utils`, `health`, `messaging`, `integrations`.

Do not add `src/controllers/` or `src/services/`. Do not split the API into seeker, partner, creators, or platform-operator folders. Actor-specific behavior stays inside the domain module.
